    "body": "I have been using the web console to \"print an object\" and copy-paste it from a web console into a file since 2010 (for debugging, comparing two versions of data), and it is suddenly broken.\r\n\r\n    console.log(JSON.stringify( {a:\"%%Hi\",b:\"%Hey\"} ));\r\n    =>  {\"a\":\"%Hi\",\"b\":\"%Hey\"}",
