    "body": "@nchevobbe It shouldn't even get there, it fails the earlier check in `Logger`. With no rest parameters, it should call straight into `Printer`, without calling into `Formatter`. That makes the screenshot incorrect, and following that would also fix @photopea's example.\r\n\r\nThat said, once properly in `Formatter`, I think escaping `%` still makes sense.",
