    "body": "As noted in https://github.com/whatwg/console/pull/218#issuecomment-1339479193, the current specification is to _not_ intepret `%` if there are no rest parameters. IIRC, this case was put into `Logger` to support logging arbitrary strings in a backwards compatible manner.",
